#8 positive.ts:20:3-39 - step-comment: use of numbered or sequenced comments that narrate the steps of the code.
#9 positive.ts:26:3-39 - obvious-comment: comment repeats the code it is attached to.
#10 positive.ts:32:3-26 - placeholder-code: placeholder code left in the source (an empty body marked TODO, or a not implemented error).
#11 positive.ts:36:16-17 - emoji-in-code: use of emoji in comments or string literals.
#12 positive.ts:37:16-17 - utf8-icons-in-code: use of utf-8 characters (arrows, check marks, bullets, box drawing) as icons in comments or string literals.
#13 positive.ts:38:18-19 - emdash-in-code: use of emdash in comments or string literals.
